# Line endings (MOM-67, from failure-log entry F-008). Every tracked file is stored with LF. `eol=lf` makes working
# copies LF on every machine (the owner's Windows checkout, project threads, CI), so a line-ending-only difference
# never shows a file as modified or blocks a pull. `text=auto` leaves anything git detects as binary alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
